---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const base = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/`;

// Sample figures for layout only. Replace them with verified data before publishing.
const statistics = [
  { label: 'Learners supported', value: '250+' },
  { label: 'Modules completed', value: '600+' },
  { label: 'Tutor sessions', value: '150+' }
];
---

<Layout
  title="Online Courses and Learning Pathways"
  description="Build skills through short online modules in Maths, Python Coding, Problem Solving and AI, with structured learning pathways and tutor guidance."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <p class="eyebrow">Online courses with tutor guidance</p>
      <h1>Structured learning with real tutor support</h1>
      <p>Choose a subject, follow a clear learning pathway and add tutor guidance when you need it.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button primary" href={`${base}courses`}>Explore courses</a>
        <a class="button secondary" href={`${base}contact`}>Help me choose</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="subjects" class="section section-surface">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Subject areas</p>
      <h2>Choose a subject</h2>
      <p>Explore available courses before deciding where to begin. Subjects still being prepared are clearly marked as coming soon.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="subject-grid">
      <a class="subject-card" href={`${base}subjects/mathematics`} aria-label="Explore Maths course">
        <span class="subject-status subject-status--available">Available now</span>
        <span class="subject-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M18 5H7l6 7-6 7h11"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Maths</h3>
        <p>Build confidence through clear explanations, worked examples and regular practice.</p>
        <span class="subject-action">Explore course</span>
      </a>

      <a class="subject-card" href={`${base}subjects/computing-ai`} aria-label="Explore Computing and AI courses">
        <span class="subject-status subject-status--available">Available now</span>
        <span class="subject-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m8 8-4 4 4 4M16 8l4 4-4 4M14 5l-4 14"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Computing &amp; AI</h3>
        <p>Learn programming, computational thinking, artificial intelligence and responsible digital skills.</p>
        <span class="subject-action">Explore subjects</span>
      </a>

      <article class="subject-card subject-card--unavailable">
        <span class="subject-status">Coming soon</span>
        <span class="subject-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.5"></circle>
            <ellipse cx="12" cy="12" rx="9" ry="3.5"></ellipse>
            <ellipse cx="12" cy="12" rx="9" ry="3.5" transform="rotate(60 12 12)"></ellipse>
            <ellipse cx="12" cy="12" rx="9" ry="3.5" transform="rotate(120 12 12)"></ellipse>
          </svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Science</h3>
        <p>Explore Biology, Chemistry and Physics through clear explanations and practical study.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="subject-card subject-card--unavailable">
        <span class="subject-status">Coming soon</span>
        <span class="subject-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5.5c3.5-1 6-.3 8 1.7v12c-2-2-4.5-2.7-8-1.7zM20 5.5c-3.5-1-6-.3-8 1.7v12c2-2 4.5-2.7 8-1.7z"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>English</h3>
        <p>Develop reading, writing and communication skills.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="subject-card subject-card--unavailable">
        <span class="subject-status">Coming soon</span>
        <span class="subject-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="m15 9-2 4-4 2 2-4z"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Religion</h3>
        <p>Explore beliefs, traditions and how religion shapes people and communities.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="subject-card subject-card--unavailable">
        <span class="subject-status">Coming soon</span>
        <span class="subject-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5h11v8H9l-4 3v-3H4zM11 13v5h5l3 2v-2h1v-8h-5"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Languages</h3>
        <p>Build communication skills and explore how languages connect people and cultures.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="section-action subject-directory-action">
      <p>Not sure which subject or level fits your goal?</p>
      <a class="button secondary" href={`${base}contact`}>Help me choose</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section statistics-panel" aria-labelledby="statistics-heading">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Sample statistics</p>
      <h2 id="statistics-heading">Progress at a glance</h2>
      <p><strong>Placeholder figures for layout only.</strong> Replace these with verified data before publishing.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="statistics-grid">
      {statistics.map((statistic) => (
        <article class="statistic-card">
          <span class="sample-badge">Sample</span>
          <p class="statistic-value">{statistic.value}</p>
          <h3>{statistic.label}</h3>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="how-it-works" class="section section-surface">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
      <h2>A clear way to learn online</h2>
      <p>Begin with the right course, work through focused modules and choose the support that fits.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step-list">
      <article class="step-card">
        <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
        <h3>Choose a course</h3>
        <p>Start with a subject and level that matches your current goal.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="step-card">
        <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
        <h3>Follow the modules</h3>
        <p>Build skills step by step through lessons and practical activities.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="step-card">
        <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
        <h3>Add tutor guidance</h3>
        <p>Choose independent learning or a plan with more regular tutor support.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="section-action">
      <a class="button secondary" href={`${base}learning-pathways`}>View learning pathways</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-surface">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Tutor support</p>
      <h2>Choose your level of support</h2>
      <p>Start independently or add regular tutor guidance for a clearer next step.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="support-preview-grid">
      <article class="support-preview-card">
        <p class="pricing-label">Independent Learning</p>
        <h3>Learn with structure</h3>
        <p class="support-preview-price">&pound;19<span>/month</span></p>
        <p>Follow a selected course with weekly lessons, activities and light tutor monitoring.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="support-preview-card featured">
        <p class="pricing-label">Tutor Guidance</p>
        <h3>Regular guidance</h3>
        <p class="support-preview-price">&pound;49<span>/month</span></p>
        <p>Add a monthly live lesson, tutor review and practice shaped around your next steps.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="support-preview-card">
        <p class="pricing-label">Focused Support</p>
        <h3>Focused preparation</h3>
        <p class="support-preview-price">&pound;89<span>/month</span></p>
        <p>Receive more regular tutor contact for a defined topic, project or examination goal.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="support-preview-note">Plan availability and current terms are confirmed before you start.</p>
    <div class="section-action">
      <a class="button secondary" href={`${base}support#pricing`}>Compare support plans</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-surface testimonial-section" aria-labelledby="testimonial-heading">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Sample testimonial</p>
      <h2 id="testimonial-heading">A learner’s perspective</h2>
    </div>

    <figure class="testimonial-card testimonial-card--single">
      <p class="testimonial-placeholder-label">Fictional example</p>
      <blockquote>
        “The weekly structure made it easier to know what to study next, and the tutor guidance helped me work through topics I found difficult.”
      </blockquote>
      <figcaption><strong>Example learner</strong> · GCSE Maths learner</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <p class="testimonial-disclaimer">
      <strong>Design placeholder only.</strong> This is not genuine learner feedback. Replace it with an approved testimonial before publishing.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section cta-section">
    <h2>Not sure where to begin?</h2>
    <p>Tell us about the subject, level or learning goal you are considering.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button primary" href={`${base}contact`}>Help me choose</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href={`${base}courses`}>Explore courses</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
